# Lamtek repo

- New integrated terminals run `scripts/activate-workspace-context.ps1` (see `.vscode/settings.json`). That targets **lamteksystem** on GitHub CLI and the Lamtek Supabase token path in `scripts/identity.config.json`.
- This is the **active** ordering portal repo (not other legacy folders on disk).

## GitHub Pages (required)

**Demo:** https://lamteksystem.github.io/lamteksystem/ — deploys automatically on every push to `main`.

After any meaningful code/docs/migration work in this repo, **before ending the turn**:

1. `npm run ship -- "short message"` — validate, remote migrations, commit, push to `main`.
2. Confirm deploy: `gh run list --workflow=deploy-github-pages.yml --limit 1` (or tell the user to hard-refresh the demo in ~2 min).

Do **not** leave UI fixes or features only on localhost. If `ship` fails, fix and retry. Never commit `.env`, `.secrets/`, `dist/`, or `supabase/.temp/`.
